BOSS Mad Blix Charge
    Events
        Time - Every (Random real number between 15.00 and 30.00) seconds of game time
    Conditions
        (BossMadBlix is alive) Equal to True
    Actions
        -------- =================================== --------
        Set VariableSet MadBlixPoint = (Position of BossMadBlix)
        Set VariableSet MadBlixTargetGroup = (Units within 700.00 of MadBlixPoint matching ((((Matching unit) is alive) Equal to True) and (((Matching unit) belongs to an enemy of (Owner of BossMadBlix).) Equal to True)).)
        Set VariableSet MadBlixTarget = (Random unit from MadBlixTargetGroup)
        -------- =================================== --------
        Unit - Order BossMadBlix to Undead Destroyer - Absorb Mana MadBlixTarget
        -------- CHAT START / DURING --------
        Trigger - Run BOSS Mad Blix Chat Special <gen> (checking conditions)
        -------- =================================== --------
        Custom script:   call DestroyGroup(udg_MadBlixTargetGroup)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_MadBlixPoint)
        -------- =================================== --------
